4. Condemns all attacks against civilians and all violations of the ceasefire by any party, including attacks against humanitarian personnel, and calls for accountability for all such violations;
5. Demands that all parties fully respect the ceasefire, cease all acts of violence, including in the West Bank, exercise maximum restraint, refrain from reprisals and ensure the protection of civilians, humanitarian personnel, medical facilities and civilian infrastructure, in accordance with international humanitarian law, including the principles of distinction, proportionality and precautions;
